# `npm run dev:verify` — the app on Neon, pointed at the isolated test branch verify-1029 (never
# Production). The /neon and /api routes run locally inside Vite (vite.config.ts, localApi).
# Public settings only; nothing secret belongs here.
VITE_DATA_SOURCE=neon
# The media service code path (business pages, photos). Without R2_* variables on this machine,
# uploads answer "storage not configured"; text posts and messages still work.
VITE_MEDIA_STORAGE=r2
